The YAML violation witness (sv-witnesses 2.2) of an unreach-call bug: the
target is the call of reach_error() on line 14 -- not the assertion inside
reach_error() on line 3, which is where the failing assertion of the trace
is. The violation is in main, so no thread needs a name and none is
registered.
